WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who 
Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.480
Hey, does this door look familiar to you?

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.490
Yes. It looks more than familiar.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.700
<b>Tachibana</b>

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.720
It even has a nameplate.

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:41.240
This doesn't fit in here at all!

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:46.250
Chapter 2 .

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:46.250
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a                               .
Fantasy Knockout and Unparalleled Beauty           .

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.500
It really is my place!

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.640
Even the garbage I forgot to take 
out is here in perfect detail!

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.010
What is with that goddess?!

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.130
I seriously don't understand 
what this skill is about.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.560
<i>Right now, all I'm thinking about 
is seeing you back to your place.</i>

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.420
<i>I see. From what I thought back then...</i>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:10.710
<i>The manner in which she 
grants wishes is a little...</i>

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:11.860
<i>sloppy!</i>

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.590
The water and electricity seem to work.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.820
<b>No Signal to TV</b>

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.820
But I guess the TV doesn't work.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.200
The windows don't open and it's 
pitch black outside, but...

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.250
this is a really useful ability!

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.640
<i>Since the norm for men is 
to eat it in one bite,</i>

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.710
<i>she looks just like a hamster.</i>

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.720
At any rate, we won't have trouble finding 
food or a place to sleep for a while.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.220
Huh? Food will be a problem, won't it?

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.220
This is all I have in 
the house. All the food.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.560
The last ones?

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.030
The last ones.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:54.950
You only have one serving! Why would 
you so thoughtlessly eat it now?

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.650
Well, I mean, I was hungry.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.620
You mean you have nothing set 
aside in case of emergencies?!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.080
Well, I don't eat at home anyway, right?

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.950
What were you planning to do if 
there was a giant earthquake?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.830
If that happened, you'd 
come and save me, right?

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:18.040
It's your fault for being so overprotective!

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:21.840
Then you should hurry up and 
become independent. You idiot.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.600
Since we have water,

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.020
we should be able to manage for a week.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:31.080
In the worst case, that bear-thing from earlier
would last us a while if we broke it down for meat.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.010
There's no way I'm ever 
eating something like that.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:36.230
You really are spoiled, aren't you?

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.630
Well... none of this changes
 what we must do:

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.740
Gather information and secure food.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.090
We should move while we're still able.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.490
You mean hiking up the mountain again?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.790
No, I think that we'll 
be done with that soon.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.500
Actually, earlier, while we 
were being chased, I saw smoke.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.250
I think there might be a settlement there.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.510
Whoa!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.790
It really looks all fantasy-esque!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.510
It's a scene you wouldn't see in Japan.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.200
But, how can I put it...

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.740
Will I be okay dressed like this?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.770
I can't wholeheartedly say it's okay.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:15.500
It's painful.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.370
It's not like I'm wearing this 
because I want to, you know!

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.740
The only clothes available were the ones 
my little sister left behind when she visited!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.860
That's true. There's 
nothing we can do about that.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:30.480
You know... You've been kinda cold 
to me since this happened to me...

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:32.370
I've always been like this.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:39.380
<b>Instincts</b>

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:39.380
<b>Reason</b>

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:39.380
<b><i>So cute So cute So cute So cute So cute</i></b>

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:35.600
Perhaps you've become overly 
self-conscious since becoming a woman.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.870
You think so?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:38.420
Yeah, maybe...

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:43.170
But it's still hard to look at you, so you need 
new clothes as soon as possible.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.820
Yeah. We need to hurry up and 
get some clothes from this world.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.560
Please do it just as we planned.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.270
Will do!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:56.720
I'm a rich young lady from a remote 
region, and you're my attendant.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.710
And I can't say why I'm traveling.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.410
But that's why I don't know this area at all.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.720
Tell me all about it!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:05.280
That's about right.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.840
You just watch. With this beauty and my 
communication skills, I'll be unstoppable.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:16.270
Right now, I'm confident I can make 
any man out there fall for me!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.720
Even though you can't 
make women fall for you.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:19.790
Shut up!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.580
Seriously. Hmph.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:24.760
<i>She's got those looks.</i>

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.930
<i>They should prove advantageous 
in any discussions.</i>

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:31.150
<i>Even if she doesn't speak the language, 
it's unlikely that she'll be treated badly.</i>

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:33.430
<i>And it's true that she's 
good at communicating.</i>

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.390
<b>Information</b>

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.390
Unparalleled Beauty

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.390
Substantial increase in favorable disposition
.                                                                                                                                                  .
during negotiations with other gender 
.                                                                      .
Likability quotient increases more easily 
.                                                                     .

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:40.500
Isn't that too much smoke 
for such a small settlement?

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.320
And it smells charred.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.070
Bandits!

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:47.220
Run!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.820
Leave everything behind!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.800
Mommy!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.390
We'll be killed!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.330
<b>Information</b>

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.330
Troublemaker                 .

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.330
Help!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.330
Tachibana!

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:01.840
There seems to be some kind of commotion. 
Are they having a festival?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.820
Outta the way!

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:04.960
Ow!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:07.240
Ow, ow, ow...

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:10.110
Man, now my clothes are all dirty.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:10.720
Huh?

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.180
You're not hurt, are you... young miss?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.430
Oh, I'm sorry to bother 
you while you're working.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.210
I'm just a little lost, you see.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:28.170
Huh? Do you maybe not understand Japanese?

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:31.160
Bonjour. Excuse me!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.080
I-Is this...

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.940
Is this... love?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.090
Huh?

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.500
Wait... Huh?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.520
Is this, like... a dangerous situation?

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.600
I thought you were a woodcutter, but...

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:46.260
Huh?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:47.580
Marry me.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.260
What did you say?

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.660
I'd quit thieving if it were for you.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.640
And I am prepared to live a decent life.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.070
We can grow vegetables or something 
to create a life for ourselves.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.640
I want two children.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.140
What is this all of a sudden?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.570
Now that that's decided,

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.860
I'll get permission from the boss 
and head back to my home country!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.550
Hey! Hang on a sec!

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.240
Hey, what are you doing 
playing around over there?

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:11.530
Big bro! Look! I've found myself a wife!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.240
A wife? What are you talking about?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.920
Marry me.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.240
Why?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.350
I'd quit thieving if it were for you.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.130
And I am prepared to live a decent life.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.310
We can make clay pots or something 
to create a life for ourselves.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.920
I want eight children.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.170
How many kids do these guys want me to have?!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.930
<b>Information</b>

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.930
Unparalleled Beauty 
.                                    .
Unbelievable beauty causes 
everyone to become incredibly
spellbound.                                 .
.                                                     .

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:29.880
<i>So, this is what that meant?</i>

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.930
<i>Is that what's going on?</i>

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:35.380
<i>My beauty really pushes people this far?</i>

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.600
Big bro, I won't let anyone steal 
my wife away, not even you!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.310
No, she will live with me! 
This calls for a duel!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.630
Marry me.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.720
I'd quit thieving if it were for you.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.140
Don't go trying to get ahead!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:49.030
What d'you think you're doing?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.700
You want a fight? Bring it on!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:08:00.200
Is this my fault? Is it?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.040
Please stop! Stop this pointless fighting!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.540
Are you safe, Tachibana?!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.030
Not for my sake... Not because of me...

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:13.700
Please don't fight!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.480
Did you... do all of this?

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.350
I haven't done anything.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.140
I was simply here.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.770
But I... I...

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.760
Because I am too beautiful, 
all of this has...

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:28.900
Tachibana.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.020
You're a little bit happy 
about this, aren't you?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:37.030
Thank you! Thank you!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.930
Thank you! Thank you!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.680
And now I'm being revered 
like some kind of deity.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:46.170
Well, it's healthier than that 
fight that broke out earlier.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.670
I really have become a woman of 
beauty that I couldn't possibly exist.

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.680
I just thought maybe 
I'd be a little bit popular.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.550
I underestimated it as well.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:00.680
Now I kind of understand a bit about
 why you started hating women.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.710
Huh? No, I... Well...

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:08.200
But for this kind of stuff to happen 
everywhere I go is a little...

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.440
Should I hide my face?

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:11.150
Like this.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.270
No.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.570
But it does seem that we'll need 
some kind of countermeasures.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.150
Now that I think about it... 
Why doesn't it affect you?

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:22.830
Huh? Oh... You mean the reason I'm fine 
even when looking you in the face?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.630
It must be because I know you're a man.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.150
I see.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.970
<i>Though, I'm not exactly unaffected, you know...</i>

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:34.190
Maybe it's got something to do with the 
intelligence setting in the parameters.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.090
I imagine it's got some 
kind of mental effect.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.090
Crap! We've been defeated!

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.600
To think we'd get distracted 
and wiped out by a lone woman.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:47.230
But you'd do well to be afraid. 
We're an advance party.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.720
In a few hours, the main group 
will realize something's wrong.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.100
They'll get ready, and they'll come here!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:57.240
We haven't said a word. They just 
started talking all on their own.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:01.870
I'm looking forward to seeing this whole 
village get crushed into the ground!

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:05.160
If they're close enough to 
guess that something's wrong,

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.110
that means their stronghold 
must be in the area.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:07.870
Huh?

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.710
Are these guys for real?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.110
Where is it?

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:16.380
I'm not telling you! You think I'm stupid?

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.220
Tachibana.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:20.620
Well, I guess I have no choice...

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.850
I do wish you'd tell me!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.490
Could it be that...

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:35.110
I'm unbeatable?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:36.990
What are you doing? Come on. Let's go.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:41.990
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.450
So cute!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.300
Well, I guess they would 
have real lookouts posted.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.210
It seems our enemies are not idiots.

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:52.430
I like that we can check their 
strengths ahead of time.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.960
Huh? You can see other people's stats, too?

00:10:54.960 --> 00:11:01.470
Strength 

00:10:54.960 --> 00:11:01.470
Strength 

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.250
Their numbers are really 
low compared to yours.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:01.470
But we don't know how far 
we can trust these.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.850
And we can't be sure of how 
many people are inside.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.470
We should go carefully.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.530
Carefully, huh?

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:11.350
Sounds like a pain. Why don't you just 
smack 'em around a bit and finish this?

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:14.940
You took out that beam-shooting bear 
with one punch. I'm sure you can do it!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.400
<b><u>Aaaaaah</u></b>

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:17.110
You make it sound so easy.

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:21.100
Back when you were student council president, 
you took out a den of delinquents.

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.680
This is just like that, right?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.570
The danger levels are entirely different!

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.530
And please don't say I took 
them out. I rehabilitated them.

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.330
That was rehabilitation?

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.720
Then, should I go?

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.050
You?

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:36.730
What can you do with those 
cannon-fodder-level stats?

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:40.470
Don't go thinking that cannon fodder 
isn't good for anything, Mr. Elite.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:41.550
<b>Ka-pow</b>

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.190
I'm gonna go crash their 
group dynamics completely!

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:46.970
Are you one of those women 
that destroys friendships?

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:50.380
Have you already forgotten that 
you were almost kidnapped?

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:53.110
Best case, you'd be married. Worst case, 
you'd have gone down a slave route.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:55.360
You say some really scary things...

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:59.420
How about you leave this to me, 
and go to your place?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.180
But, I mean...

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:06.690
No matter how strong you are, it's not 
right letting you face danger alone.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.370
Tachibana.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.370
<i>Really... It's that part of you that's so...</i>

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.990
<i>How can I put it? So... needlessly kind.</i>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.130
<i>"I'm sure you can just leave this to me."</i>

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:25.140
Middle School

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>"I can find a way on my own.
 I'll make it work."</i>

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:30.020
<i>"Do things for others. Sacrifice 
yourself to make that happen."</i>

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:32.570
<i>That's how I was raised.</i>

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:35.520
<i>I have never doubted or 
questioned it. And yet...</i>

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:39.020
Whoa... They're making you 
handle all the paperwork again?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:40.570
Tachibana?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.990
I mean, there's supposed to be 
two of you doing this, right?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.030
Where's the other guy?

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:45.790
Team practice.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:49.030
Ran out on you, huh? 
They really are just using you.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.700
Come on. Hand 'em over.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.630
Huh?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.000
I'm in the going home club.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.170
And even if I do go home, 
I've got nothing to do.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.430
And even you think these are a pain, right?

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.170
I'm so sorry to make you 
handle all these little jobs.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.430
Jinguuji-kun, you're just so mature, 
I end up relying on you.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:09.420
Sorry! I've got team practice.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.930
The tournament's coming up. 
I feel really bad, but...

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.450
That's true.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.210
In that case, I'm compiling statistics 
from the future plans questionnaires...

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.720
It's better if you don't ask 
me to do stuff like statistics.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.420
Then, could you staple them for me?

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.950
Nice. That's the kind of thing I can do.

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:31.460
<i>Even though he knew it would be a pain, 
he couldn't pretend he didn't see.</i>

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:35.080
<i>He's a person who can do things for 
others when it really counts...</i>

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:39.030
<i>instead of being someone who just 
does as they're told, like me.</i>

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.590
<i>Honestly. He's always like this.</i>

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:48.340
<i>So cute. I'm in love. Let's get married.</i>

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:53.000
<i>Wait. What was that reaction just now?</i>

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.860
<i>Cute? Well, I suppose that's acceptable.</i>

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.390
<i>But marriage?</i>

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.870
<i>Are you stupid? It's too soon to get married.</i>

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.500
<i>We haven't even dated yet.</i>

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:07.540
There's something wrong with me!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.140
What's wrong, Jinguuji?!

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.720
<i>Why? It's getting worse by the minute!</i>

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.830
<i>My thoughts are filled with Tachibana!</i>

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.380
<i>Is this the curse, too?</i>

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.300
Hey. Are you okay?

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.150
<i>Tachibana...</i>

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:35.770
<i>Right now... if I catch even 
a glimpse of her... I will...</i>

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.390
Man, that looks like it hurts...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.650
Cuts to the forehead really 
bleed a ton, don't they?

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.650
Tachibana...

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.200
I...

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:50.020
I... I...

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:51.820
I...

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:55.080
I!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.510
It's an enemy raid!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.710
I... I...

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.500
I think you should cherish yourself more!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.470
What brought this on all of a sudden?!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.140
Why is your chest so recklessly 
exposed?! What if you catch a chill!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.640
Cover up!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:26.000
What? It's not like 
I want to dress like this!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.900
What's this? A falling out between comrades?

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.950
There's only two of 'em! 
And one of them's a woman.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.160
Doesn't look like we needed 
to bring everyone out here.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.760
Hey, look! The woman's really pretty.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.420
Seems like she takes care of herself. 
I think we can expect good things.

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.540
Take the woman alive! Kill the man!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.630
Take that!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.760
You little...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.760
Take that!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.340
How dare you do that to my comrades?!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.340
Take that!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:56.850
Take that! Take that! Take 
that! Take that! Take that!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.100
He's burying those people like 
he's planting a rice paddy.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:56.850
Goddess!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:00.780
I have convinced the people of 
the village to come to your aid!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:01.850
Village chief!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.760
Take that!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.520
Chief!

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.060
Stay away from Tachibana!

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.120
Jinguuji!

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.530
You're acting really weird!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.140
Are you okay?

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.220
Weird?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.660
Yes. It's true that something isn't right...

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.890
Earlier, it was burned into my 
eyes and I can't unsee it...

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:22.800
What was?

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.360
Your...

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:26.670
Me?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.880
My what?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.760
Well, that's...

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:35.680
<b> ♥ Charmed</b>

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:35.680
I can't really say...

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.680
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:43.180
<i>This... is totally my fault.</i>

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.190
Just admit it, Jinguuji.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:52.440
If you're being honest, you 
think I'm super cute, right?

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:56.360
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.360
No. Not cute at all.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.620
<i>Completely unconvincing!</i>

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.450
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.800
Jinguuji, look up.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:00.450
Up?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.580
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:02.580
What's this?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.830
Charmed?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.080
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:06.080
Charmed.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.540
Oh...

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.840
I... I know this will sound 
like an excuse, but...

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.420
I want you to understand...

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.080
I have no interest in young girls.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:18.430
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.430
It's really, completely 
outside my preferences.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.000
And blondes... really aren't my thing.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.800
But your hair is so soft and beautiful,

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.200
and the way it shines...

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:27.940
Even at night, it illuminates your face...

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:32.190
<b> ♥ Charmed</b>

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.520
It's as though you are my sun.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:44.920
<i>Th-This is terrifying!</i>

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:47.780
<i>It makes it so that people can't control 
their own thoughts and feelings!</i>

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.840
<i>Is this how the "charmed" effect works?</i>

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:52.210
<i>Seriously, the power of my 
appearance is way too strong!</i>

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:57.330
<i>This is crazy... I have to do something 
before something really bad happens!</i>

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:58.840
Tachibana...

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.640
Sorry, Jinguuji!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.750
I mean, I was in a panic,
but I slapped you really hard!

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:09.480
No. This was my fault, too.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:10.910
More importantly...

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.940
<b> ♥ Charmed</b>

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.230
Huh?

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:14.540
You're all better?

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:16.460
I'm all better.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:25.200
Don't feel so down.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.500
I've never experienced... 
a disgrace of this magnitude.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.480
What a blunder.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.980
Here's some water.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:35.870
But now that it's come to this, we really 
need to come up with countermeasures.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:37.810
I'd rather not get slapped again.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:39.590
Getting better after being hit...

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.100
You're like a broken television!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:42.970
Shut up.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.100
All right already. There's no use 
crying over spilled milk.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.040
Let's switch gears!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.360
Right now...

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:57.490
Let's get drunk on the beauty of victory!

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:03.860
Just look at this! It's amazing! 
You think it's the currency of this world?

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.800
They've hoarded quite a lot.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.200
So, what do you want to do 
with this huge haul of loot?

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:13.540
Please, you should have it. We'd like 
you to accept it as our tribute to you.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.210
No way! I don't need all this!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.360
I certainly can't say that we 
didn't hope for compensation,

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:24.020
but all of this must have 
been pillaged from this area.

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:29.100
But you are the saviors of our village. 
Please allow us to repay you.

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.920
When you put it that way, 
it's difficult to refuse...

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.230
Oh! In that case...

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.620
There's something I want!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.040
What do you think?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.910
It doesn't expose very much
 and it fits me perfectly.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.040
Clothing? I see.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.580
I suppose it's all right.

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:56.070
<i>Jinguuji.</i>

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:58.600
<i>You're doing that to hide your 
embarrassment, aren't you?</i>

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:02.150
<i>That's what the fact that you 
can be charmed means, right?</i>

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.320
<i>This guy...</i>

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:09.890
<i>He might talk like that, but inside, he finds 
this appearance so cute he can't stand it, right?</i>

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:13.550
<i>This is awesome! It feels so good!</i>

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:18.400
<i>I had no idea that being cute 
made you feel so omnipotent!</i>

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.280
Pow! Pow! Pow! Pow! Pow! Pow!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.160
Ow! That hurts! I give up! I give up!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.660
What was all that supposed to be?

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:33.790
Well, you may be unhappy since someone's 
got hold of a weakness of yours, but...

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.540
It's a good thing that it's me, right?

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.050
Huh?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.800
Do you smell something weird?

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.060
F-F-F-F-F...

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.810
Fire!

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.130
Jinguuji! This is bad!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:57.670
Fire! There's a fire!

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.070
Hey! Jinguuji!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.740
I see. So someone's got 
hold of my weakness...

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.740
It's the first time this has happened to me.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:13.230
This is not the time to be 
basking in your emotions!

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:23.970
Is it morning?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.440
Sateyna, are you there?

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:28.540
Here.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:37.690
I see I'm just as beautiful as ever today.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.680
Premier, um...

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:43.290
Yes, yes. "You are as lovely 
as ever today," right?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.440
I'm tired of hearing that.

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.390
Oh, no, that isn't...

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:49.080
Well then, let's work our 
hardest for another day.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.110
Premier!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.950
We shall work for the sake of 
this beautiful elven forest!

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.440
It... It...

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:03.320
It's been burned to the ground!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.720
<b>with</b>

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:37.070
What's wrong, Tachibana?

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:39.530
I saw one! In my room! One of 
those things that start with "c"!

00:23:39.530 --> 00:23:42.240
Calm down, Tachibana. Open the door 
wide, spray a little peppermint oil...

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:42.850
See? It ran.

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:43.550
Whoa!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 3

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:45.480
The real problem is this world, 
with its complete lack of insects,

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:48.000
and whether it's all right for us 
to have released that thing into it.

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.990
Destroying an ecosystem is bad! Really bad!
